# Local machine config. NEVER commit these -- they carry internal hostnames,
# IP addresses and account names.
#
# Why the patterns are unanchored: the previous version pinned the spotlight
# config to `spotlight_options/ghostty_commands.json`. Commit b156a9d moved it to
# `modules/spotlight/config/`, the pattern silently stopped matching, and the file
# was committed to a PUBLIC repo for three months carrying two internal IPs and an
# SSH key path. A leading-slash path is only as good as the last refactor; match on
# the filename so a move cannot re-open the hole.
ghostty_commands.json
insights.env

# Wallpaper videos and the generated player page.
data/
